  "id": "authored-conflicting-field-label-semantics",
  "title": "Conflicting field labels and credential value semantics (authored)",
  "description": "Hand-written inputs for cases where the field label and the value disagree: a documented secret under a public or ordinary label, a documented public key under a matching, ordinary or secret-like label, repeated labels holding a public and a secret value, and an opaque key shape whose public or secret reading the text alone cannot settle. Every value is synthetic: its random part begins with the literal word synthetic and continues with characters derived from a SHA-512 of a fixed label, so it was never issued by any provider and was never tested against a service; the Supabase checksums are computed over a synthetic project reference. Items marked metamorphic-of keep the value bytes of their base and change only the label, nesting or carrier. Unresolved items assert no outcome.",
  "origin": {
    "type": "authored-cases"
  },
